                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.51/1735: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Caffery</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-03-05T21:00:00-05:00">March 5, 1940—9 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>54. Discussions still continue with Council but hope for favorable result
                    tomorrow. Please try to hold matters open. Possibly Aranha <pb facs="0604"
                        n="592" xml:id="pg592"/> could obtain authority to make offer immediately
                    upon receiving proposed assurances.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
